{"seq":1,"slug":"color-theory","title":"色彩理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-models","title":"色彩模型：RGB、HSL 与 Lab","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-models","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-wheel-harmony","title":"色轮与色彩和谐","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-wheel-harmony","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-color-pipeline","title":"数字成像色彩流水线","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/digital-color-pipeline","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 色彩理论 简介\n\n色彩理论（Color Theory）研究颜色的分类、组合和感知规律。本章从 RGB、HSL、CIELAB 三大色彩模型入手，解析色轮关系、色彩和谐原则，以及数字成像中色彩从物理光谱到像素数值的转换路径。理解色彩模型是后续色彩管理和调色工作的数学基础。\n"}